/* VERSION12 DOOR / WINDOW PREVIEW - DISABLED.
   The previous version generated incorrectly positioned box-based
   frames, confirmed visually in the user's 3ds Max screenshot.
   This file now does NOTHING other than display a warning.
   To remove generated preview objects, run:
   cad_data/3dsmax_scripts/VERSION12_REMOVE_BAD_DOOR_WINDOW_PREVIEW.ms
*/
messageBox "The previous door/window preview was DISABLED because it generated poorly aligned geometry.\n\nRun VERSION12_REMOVE_BAD_DOOR_WINDOW_PREVIEW.ms to remove its added objects. Existing walls and slabs will not be modified." title:"VERSION12 - door/window preview disabled"
